To run the pytest, use:
pytest [options]

Options:
-v - verbose
-x - stop on first fail
-s - transfer console output to pytest output
-k key_word - runs only files and tests with key_word in the name in the current directory and subdirectories
file_name - specify file name to run all tests in the file
-m 'mark_names expression' - to run cases with specified mark names. supports "not mark_name" and combinations

Pytest file should start with test_ or end with _test
Tests should start with test key word

Annotations:
@pytest.mark.[mark_name] - marks should be registered in pytest.ini file
